      "x": 3350,
      "y": -1649,
      "name": "sticky_behavior_note",
      "width": 320,
      "height": 280,
      "content": "STICKY (linha mobile v2)\n\nHeader brand: 60px (fix)\nChips sticky top: 60px (sob o header)\nTitulo da linha: NAO sticky — rola embora\n\nHero (titulo): pad 20/16/12/16; nome 36/700 lh 1.15\nChips bar: 69px (12+44+12+1)\nChip: h 44, pad-x 16, gap 10\nActive $color.brand / $color.brandContrast\nInactive $color.chipInactive / $color.chipLabel\n\nAlternativa sticky titulo+chips (~142px) — rejeitada: comprime viewport; titulo hero deve respirar."
    },
